1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,598
At constant pressure, delta H is delta U plus p delta V.

2
00:00:05,598 --> 00:00:10,312
And the first law says delta U is q p minus p delta V.

3
00:00:10,312 --> 00:00:14,166
Add them, and the p delta V terms cancel.

4
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:22,265
Delta H is just the heat exchanged at constant pressure, exactly what a calorimeter open to the air measures.

